Never doubt the impact of an emoji!
Quoting @JoeMaristela
@vanstriendaniel @argilla_io @huggingface Oh wow, they added a new icon to indicate datasets created using Distilabel on the Hugging Face Hub? 🤩 How exciting! Because that's definitely the most important thing when it comes to building high-quality AI models - having a fancy icon next to your dataset.

ChatRAG Bench is a benchmark dataset from @nvidia for evaluating a model's conversational QA capability over documents or retrieved context covering many documents and question types.
